    "localized": {
      "ko_KR": {
        "name": "우주의 창조자",
        "summary": "아우렐리온 솔이 스킬로 피해를 입히면 각 스킬을 영구히 강화하는 <font color='#3458eb'>별가루</font>를 획득합니다. ",
        "tooltip": "아우렐리온 솔이 스킬로 피해를 입히면 스킬을 강화하는 <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">별가루</span>를 획득합니다.<span><span></span>: 폭발 시 <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">최대 체력의 에 해당하는 마법 피해</span>를 추가로 입힙니다.</span><span><span></span>: 거리가 증가합니다.</span><span><span></span>: 범위가 증가하고 처형 기준값이 <span></span> 증가됩니다.</span><span><span> 및 </span>: 범위가 증가합니다.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">아우렐리온 솔이 획득한 <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">별가루</span>: <span style=\"color: #3458eb\"></span></span>"
      },
      "en_US": {
        "name": "Cosmic Creator",
        "summary": "Aurelion Sol's damaging Abilities break down enemies into stacks of <font color='#3458eb'>Stardust</font>, which permanently improves each of his abilities. ",
        "tooltip": "Aurelion Sol's damaging Abilities break down enemies into <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">Stardust</span>, which improves his Abilities.<span><span></span>: Bursts deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\"> max Health magic damage</span></span><span><span></span>: increased distance.</span><span><span></span>: increased area and <span></span> bonus execute threshold.</span><span><span> and </span>: increased area.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Aurelion Sol has acquired <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">Stardust</span>: <span style=\"color: #3458eb\"></span></span>"
      },
      "zh_CN": {
